AkBBBCAGADCGAECCCBDADBCCBEEFDGADAIAEBCBBCAvBBCCKBACDEAIAEDFAGADIHAIAGBFBGAIADDHAGAIADAHAEBCABCABBDCABDAiBBECCEAIAHAIADBH
