IAFBGADAHAEBCBBBAjBBCCGBEAIBFCJBDAvBBCCBGADBIAFBEJCAIAGACAEBFAGAIAHADFHAIAGBFBGBHADBHAIAHAFCDBEACBBBADBEAjBBFEAGAHAEACAE
AFAEAHADAFAEBCABCAFBBAaBDCCBFAMBPAwBBCCBEAGADCHAGAFJEAHAFAEBFBGAIADHHADBIAGCDCIAGAHAFAEBGADAIACBBCAqBBCCAFBGBEACDEBGADAI
AEBCBBDAABGAZBJASBKAwBBCCBEAFBGADDIAGCIDGCHAFDGAIADJHBDBHBDCGAFBECCAEADAHABCArBBAAACAGAFAEACABBCEEBIADAIAEBCBBLAZBFAwCBC
