BKCBEAGADCIAGAFBEFFAGAHADAIAEBCABBAoGBBCBFAHADBIAGAFBEAGAIACCBDADBCCAEAFAHADBHAGAFAEBCCECFBHADAFAEACABCAnGBCCAEBGAHADBIA
FCHAEBCABDADBCCAEBGADCGAFBEACEEAFCDBEACBBBAoGBBCBECFAHADBIAGAHAFAEACBBKCAEAFAHADBHAGAFAEBCDEAFBIADBFAEACABBApGBCCBECGAHA
DCIAEBCBBJCBEAFAHADCIAFAEBCCEBGADAHADAFAEACABBApGBDCCEDFAIADBFAEACBBJCBEAFAGAHADCGAEACCEBHAGAHADAFAEACABBArGBDCDECFADAHA
EBCHBDCBEBFAIADBHAFAGAICGAHAGAIADAGAEACABBAsGBFCCEBIADAFAECCBEACAIAHABECBECFAIADAGAFAEAFBIADAHAIADAIACBBBAvGBECBEAFADAIA
EFGADAFACABFCBEACAEAGACCEBFAHCDAFACBBBAxGBDCBEAIADAHAFCGAHADAGACBBHCGEBFAHAFADAFAEACABCAzGBCCBEAFADFGACBBDABBFCDECHBIAEA
CBBBA1GBCCCEAICGAEACCBCAEBFCBEBIADAFAEACBBCA2GBCCJBCAHBECABAFADAIACCBCA4GBDCFBDAKBCEAFAHAGAEACBBCA6GBLALBCEAGAFACCBCA9GB
